# Docker

## Quick start

```bash
cp .env.example .env          # fill in OAUTH_ISSUER_URI, DB_HOST, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD
docker compose up -d --build
docker compose ps             # wait for STATUS to read (healthy)
docker compose logs -f
```

